abstract: "Python spatial simulation of woodland biomass, wood harvest and potential charcoal supply under mapped community forest management rules at Ulaya Mbuyuni, Tanzania. Six analytical rasters, scenario configurations, full numerical outputs, parameter draws and figure scripts support computational reproduction."
